accountable for that order.

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.600
This can be verified by checking
the computer logs

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.290
of the Public Safety and
Security Agency.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:04.240
In other words, if someone is to be
held accountable for this incident,

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:07.400
that person will be none
other than myself.

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:16.220
Besides, what would be far worse
is to learn that our computers

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:18.850
were hacked and orders falsified to
make them appear legitimate.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:21.150
Let's drop this issue now.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:28.630
The reason I had the TA Company
report to me is because

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:31.400
I have a far more important matter
to discuss with you.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.860
Important matter?

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:36.170
As of 1100 hours today,

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:37.740
the 3rd Experimental Company's
alert status

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:40.030
is to be upgraded to Defcon 4.

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:44.180
You are to report directly to the Public
Safety and Security Agency.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:47.280
Defcon 4? Expect hostilities
in the imminent future?!

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:50.870
But why would we go to Defcon 4
if we are putting down riots?

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.490
I can't say yet.

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:57.220
But let me just say this much.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:20:01.290
I've received intelligence that reports
the US aircraft carriers,

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:03.760
currently headed for Tokyo Bay,

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:06.420
have onboard the TA's that
were used in Belgistan.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:14.000
Understood, but I have one
issue to address.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:18.640
Regarding the damaged TA
and our missing pilot...

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:23.210
The TA has been transported back
to Gowa Central Labs.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:27.320
With regards to your pilot, soon...

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:32.150
It looks like he's here already.
Come in!

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:41.400
Captain Gowa, reporting
as ordered, Sir.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.870
Captain Gowa?

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.300
Yushiro...

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.410
Lieutenant Colonel Hayakawa,

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:52.470
you are blessed with
wonderful officers.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:05.620
Capacity phase shift phenomenon?

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:07.730
Why? Why would something
like that happen?

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:10.960
Someone's there! There's someone
standing in front of the kugai!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:26.010
CVN-77 to HS-24,

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.110
virtual construction
deployment complete.

00:21:28.110 --> 00:21:30.320
Begin drop training exercises.

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:33.790
HS-24 to CVN-77,

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.620
beginning drop training exercises.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:01.250
Invest Japan's aggregate
financial assets?

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.220
They would never dare...

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:07.150
It's up to you to believe it
or not, Mr. President.

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:10.120
These are matters outside our
immediate interests.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:12.820
But I am not about to make any moves

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:15.190
without information that can
be substantiated.

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:18.900
There is a way to gather information.

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:21.530
Simply cast the first stone,

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:24.330
right at the center of
Japan's nerve center.

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:32.850
Hark

00:22:34.110 --> 00:22:39.400
It's time I journey

00:22:42.930 --> 00:22:50.070
Break apart my heart

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:56.600
For crimson sadness

00:22:56.930 --> 00:23:04.110
Pours out from it

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:08.030
I can only, oh

00:23:08.140 --> 00:23:11.220
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:16.830
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:35.930
I can only, oh

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:39.080
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:39.150 --> 00:23:44.280
I pray, let this break apart

00:24:00.030 --> 00:24:01.860
Open your heart, Miharu.

00:24:02.800 --> 00:24:05.600
Abandoning your soul won't absolve
you of your sorrow.

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.770
Even if we are burdened by memories
spanning a thousand years,

00:24:08.770 --> 00:24:10.470
we have a tomorrow to live for.

00:24:11.410 --> 00:24:13.750
Time is not unchanging.

00:24:13.750 --> 00:24:15.470
Fate is not carved in stone.

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:18.120
As my yell rings out

00:24:18.120 --> 00:24:20.750
Through the depths of the abyss
of eternal darkness

00:24:20.750 --> 00:24:23.740
I pray hoping, may my voice resonate
with your frozen soul

00:24:24.760 --> 00:24:27.090
Come back to us, Miharu!
